# `src` folder structure

Match the layout used by `DHAMMA_JUNGLE_UI`:

```
src/
  app.tsx
  main.tsx
  config.ts
  styles.css
  vite-env.d.ts
  components/     # shared UI (sidebar, toolbar, …)
  handlers/       # API / data handlers
  hooks/          # React hooks
  interfaces/     # TypeScript interfaces
  layouts/        # route layouts (e.g. home.layout.tsx)
  pages/          # route pages, grouped by area (e.g. pages/home/…)
  providers/      # React context providers
  resources/      # static/config resources (e.g. resources/env/)
  tools/          # pure utility helpers
```

- Put feature pages under `pages/<area>/<feature>/`.
- Prefer `*.handler.ts`, `*.hook.ts`, `*.interface.ts`, `*.provider.tsx`, `*.layout.tsx`, `*.tool.ts` suffixes like the reference app.
